div><h3>Data platforms &amp; integrations</h3><p>Connect APIs, operational systems, warehouses, and governed data models.</p></div></li>\n    <li><span>03</span><div><h3>Analytics &amp; decision systems</h3><p>Build dashboards and analytical products that answer a business question, not merely display metrics.</p></div></li>\n    <li><span>04</span><div><h3>Applied AI &amp; internal tools</h3><p>Use AI where it creates leverage—search, classification, summarization, forecasting, and workflow assistance—with appropriate human oversight.</p></div></li>\n    <li><span>05</span><div><h3>Governance &amp; ongoing improvement</h3><p>Design traceable, secure, maintainable workflows for high-accountability environments.</p></div></li>\n  </ol>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"proof-section section-grid\" aria-labelledby=\"proof-title\">\n  <div class=\"section-heading proof-heading\"><p class=\"section-kicker\">EliOra internal R&amp;D</p><h2 id=\"proof-title\">Proof you can<br><em>use.</em></h2><p>Our lab turns complex data into decision interfaces. These are interactive prototypes and internal R&amp;D—not client claims.</p></div>\n  <div class=\"project-list\">\n    <article class=\"project-row\">\n      <a class=\"project-preview preview-executive\" href=\"site/executive-demo.html\" aria-label=\"Open Executive Decision Intelligence prototype\">\n        <span class=\"preview-label\">EXEC / 01</span><span class=\"preview-title\">Decision<br>intelligence</span><span class=\"preview-bars\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"preview-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span>\n      </a>\n      <div class=\"project-copy\"><p class=\"project-category\">Executive view</p><h3>Executive Decision Intelligence</h3><p>A command view for elite football operations.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"site/executive-demo.html\">Open prototype <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"project-row\">\n      <a class=\"project-preview preview-player\" href=\"site/player-st.html\" aria-label=\"Open Striker Comparison Prototype\">\n        <span class=\"preview-label\">PLAYER / 02</span><span class=\"preview-title\">Striker<br>comparison</span><span class=\"preview-radar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"preview-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span>\n      </a>\n      <div class=\"project-copy\"><p class=\"project-category\">Player view</p><h3>Striker Comparison Prototype</h3><p>Compare player profiles, role fit, similarity, and performance context.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"site/player-st.html\">Open prototype <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"project-row\">\n      <a class=\"project-preview preview-team\" href=\"site/team-prototype.html\" aria-label=\"Open Team Comparison Prototype\">\n        <span class=\"preview-label\">TEAM / 03</span><span class=\"preview-title\">Team<br>signals</span><span class=\"preview-chart\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"preview-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span>\n      </a>\n      <div class=\"project-copy\"><p class=\"project-category\">Team view</p><h3>Team Comparison Prototype</h3><p>Explore team styles, underlying performance, and decision signals.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"site/team-prototype.html\">Open prototype <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"approach-section section-grid\" aria-labelledby=\"approach-title\">\n  <div class=\"section-heading\"><p class=\"section-kicker\">How we work</p><h2 id=\"approach-title\">A clear path from<br><em>question to system.</em></h2></div>\n  <ol class=\"chapter-list\">\n    <li><span>01</span><div><h3>Frame the decision</h3><p>Start with the recurring decision, not the newest technology.</p></div></li>\n    <li><span>02</span><div><h3>Build the system</h3><p>Create the data path, interface, validation, and controls as one coherent product.</p></div></li>\n    <li><span>03</span><div><h3>Operationalize the result</h3><p>Document it, hand it over, and improve it with real use.</p></div></li>\n  </ol>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"founders-preview section-grid\" aria-labelledby=\"founders-title\">\n  <div class=\"section-heading\"><p class=\"section-kicker\">People behind the practice</p><h2 id=\"founders-title\">Technical depth.<br><em>Business clarity.</em></h2><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"about.html\">Meet the founders <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div>\n  <div class=\"founder-teaser-list\">\n    <article class=\"founder-teaser\"><img src=\"assets/optimized/tev-headshot.png\" alt=\"Tevin Engle, Co-Founder and Chief Compliance Officer\" width=\"220\" height=\"220\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div><p class=\"project-category\">Co-Founder / Chief Compliance Officer</p><h3>Tevin Engle</h3><p>Compliance, regulatory strategy, and AI governance for high-accountability environments.</p></div></article>\n    <article class=\"founder-teaser\"><img src=\"assets/optimized/shingi-headshot.png\" alt=\"Shingai Nindi, Co-Founder and Lead Data Engineer\" width=\"220\" height=\"220\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div><p class=\"project-category\">Co-Founder / Lead Data Engineer</p><h3>Shingai Nindi</h3><p>Secure data platforms, AI infrastructure, and analytical systems that hold up in practice.</p></div></article>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"final-cta\" aria-labelledby=\"final-cta-title\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">The next useful move</p><h2 id=\"final-cta-title\">What is your team still<br><em>doing by hand?</em></h2><a class=\"button button-primary\" href=\"contact.html\">Start a project <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></section>\n\n</main>\n```\n"},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":n